--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 207ddad3e1c90594ba3f48e2a5a6a796, type: 3}
  m_Name: 7. CardFieldTut
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - bodyText: 'Each Action has two key stats: Power and Speed.'
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ef17277e1ebf2f64abf4d8a5117608a3, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: <i>Power</i> shows how much damage the Action can deal.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3fea2e94140c08246a0e502ee92d3761, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: "It\u2019s a range that damage will be randomly rolled within."
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3fea2e94140c08246a0e502ee92d3761, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: And <i>Speed</i> decides when the Action takes place during combat.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b1411cc1e1231574797f223a58264863, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: Higher Speed means the Action resolves earlier in the fight.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b1411cc1e1231574797f223a58264863, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: '<i>Check the Dialogue History in the Pause Menu [Esc.] when you feel
      like you missed something!</i> '
    speakerName: Tutorial
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 751635a2cbd6d43cb92d4ab186c2a350, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: "Let\u2019s pick a card and target the enemy!"
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6f8ab552348e73941b245fe9ca454974, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 1
